    "text": "Every change needs a bullet under `## Unreleased` in CHANGELOG.md in the same turn as the code — write it as `- \\`command \\`--flag` description.` matching the existing bullet style (e.g. `- \\`summary --month YYYY-MM\\` command: per-category totals for one month.`); the user will flag its absence.",
